    "background": "The green fells of the Lake District under soft overcast daylight, neutral cool-toned white balance. Softly blurred green fell slopes rise behind the campsite, heather and bracken texture dissolving into atmospheric haze with natural distance falloff. A flat level patch of short cropped grass extends across the foreground beneath and around the tent, no rocks or boulders visible. A subtle ground shadow grounds the tent on the grass.",
