      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "A few distant sheep grazing as small pale specks scattered across the far slope in the upper-right background, very small in scale, softened by atmospheric haze."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Glaramara two-person tent in sand beige, fully pitched and shown complete from peak to groundsheet, centered in the frame with breathing room above and to the sides. Twin-arch freestanding silhouette with a low front porch and a rear porch. Two separate doors with YKK zippers and storm flaps, mesh inner panels visible through the open doorways. Sand beige fly sheet with subtle seam-taped construction lines. Held in sharp focus."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Four taut guy lines radiating from the tent corners and mid-fly, each pegged into the turf with small aluminum stakes flush to the ground. Lines extend outward from the tent to anchor points in the surrounding grass."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Out-of-focus tuft of grass at the lower-left foreground edge, soft green blades blurred by proximity to the camera."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "A single fallen leaf resting on the grass near the lower-left foreground edge, muted brown tone, slightly out of focus."
      }
    ]
  }
}
